<title>USA: Hoke Cty, N.C., won by Craigie [CORRECTED 19:46 GMT].</title>
<headline>Hoke Cty, N.C., won by Craigie [CORRECTED 19:46 GMT].</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Craigie Inc (corrects from Wachovia Bank) said Tuesday it won $4.38 million Hoke County, N.C., general obligation refunding bonds with a true interest cost of 5.0169 percent (corrects from 5.02 percent).  </p>
<p>AMT: 4,380,000	DATE: 10/15/96	NYC Time: 1100	CUSIP: 434668</p>
<p>ISSUER: Hoke County						     ST: NC</p>
<p>ISSUE: Refunding, series 1996					TAX STAT: Exempt-ULT</p>
<p>M/SP/F: A/NA/NA							   BOOK ENTRY: Y</p>
<p>ENHANCEMENTS: MBIA Aaa/AAA/NA					 BANK QUAL: Y</p>
<p>DTD: 11/01/96							     SURE BID: N</p>
<p>DUE: 4/1/97-12						SR MGR: Craigie</p>
<p>1ST CPN: 04/01/97					   DOLLAR BID: 100.00</p>
<p>CALL: See Notes					     TIC 5.0169</p>
<p>DELIVERY: 11/6/96 approx				  ORDERS:</p>
<p>PAYING AGENT: County Treasurer's Office, Raeford</p>
<p>L.O.: Brown &amp; Wood, New York City</p>
<p>F.A.: Wachovia Bank of North Carolina, Winston-Salem</p>
<p>LAST SALE: $3,600,000 AMBAC 4/2/91 @ 6.7085% NIC; 11yrs 8mos avg; BBI-7.14%</p>
<p>NOTES: Callable on 4/1/06 @ par &amp; accd. int. plus a prem. of 0.5% for ea.</p>
<p>NOTES: full or part yr. btwn. redempt. &amp; maty. dates, prem. NX 2%.</p>
